OL,3,GNEWSAAirport to be sold by April says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has confirmed it hopes
OL,7,Fto sell an airport by April "at the
OL,8,Flatest".
OL,10,FThe previous sale of Gloucestershire
OL,11,FAirport, which is jointly owned by
OL,12,FGloucester City Council (GCC) and
OL,13,FCheltenham Borough Council, fell
OL,14,Fthrough in March after eight months of
OL,15,Fnegotiations.
OL,17,FFinal bids for the airport, which is
OL,18,Flisted with a guide price of #25m
OL,19,Fthrough the property agent Savills,
OL,20,Fwill close on 30 September.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
