OL,3,GNEWSAAirport to be sold by April says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at a city council meeting last
OL,7,Fweek, leader Jeremy Hilton said there
OL,8,Fhad been a "good number of enquiries"
OL,9,Fabout the airport.
